[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.54,
    "text": "这地图，你应该一眼就认出来了。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 0,
    "original_end_ms": 2540
  },
  {
    "start": 2.54,
    "end": 3.4,
    "text": "没错，",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 2540,
    "original_end_ms": 3400
  },
  {
    "start": 3.433,
    "end": 4.933,
    "text": "坦克大战第一关。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 3433,
    "original_end_ms": 4933
  },
  {
    "start": 4.933,
    "end": 7.793,
    "text": "我把它做成了一个3D网页小游戏。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 4933,
    "original_end_ms": 7793
  },
  {
    "start": 7.833,
    "end": 9.153,
    "text": "还是那套玩法：",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 7833,
    "original_end_ms": 9153
  },
  {
    "start": 9.153,
    "end": 11.713,
    "text": "开坦克，打砖墙，守住",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 9153,
    "original_end_ms": 11713
  },
  {
    "start": 11.713,
    "end": 14.553,
    "text": "底下那只老鹰。别只顾着往前冲，",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 11713,
    "original_end_ms": 14553
  },
  {
    "start": 14.6,
    "end": 16.8,
    "text": "自家的炮弹也能把它打坏。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 14600,
    "original_end_ms": 16800
  },
  {
    "start": 16.867,
    "end": 20.387,
    "text": "红色坦克带着道具。捡到星星升级火力，",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 16867,
    "original_end_ms": 20387
  },
  {
    "start": 20.533,
    "end": 23.653,
    "text": "铁锹能临时给基地换上钢墙。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 20533,
    "original_end_ms": 23653
  },
  {
    "start": 23.667,
    "end": 26.457,
    "text": "其实做的时候，最先翻车的是这只老鹰。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 23667,
    "original_end_ms": 26457
  },
  {
    "start": 26.457,
    "end": 28.047,
    "text": "第一版像只鸭子。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 26457,
    "original_end_ms": 28047
  },
  {
    "start": 28.047,
    "end": 29.887,
    "text": "改了白头、钩喙和翅膀，",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 28047,
    "original_end_ms": 29887
  },
  {
    "start": 29.887,
    "end": 31.487,
    "text": "才终于像那么回事。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 29887,
    "original_end_ms": 31487
  },
  {
    "start": 31.487,
    "end": 33.917,
    "text": "现在可以切换斜俯视和俯视，",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 31487,
    "original_end_ms": 33917
  },
  {
    "start": 33.917,
    "end": 35.827,
    "text": "找一个看得清路的角度。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 33917,
    "original_end_ms": 35827
  },
  {
    "start": 35.867,
    "end": 38.227,
    "text": "这一局，二十辆敌人清完，",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 35867,
    "original_end_ms": 38227
  },
  {
    "start": 38.227,
    "end": 40.127,
    "text": "老鹰还在，过关。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 38227,
    "original_end_ms": 40127
  },
  {
    "start": 40.127,
    "end": 41.767,
    "text": "目前只有第一关。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 40127,
    "original_end_ms": 41767
  },
  {
    "start": 41.767,
    "end": 43.797,
    "text": "电脑和手机横屏都能玩，",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 41767,
    "original_end_ms": 43797
  },
  {
    "start": 43.833,
    "end": 45.573,
    "text": "链接放在简介里。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 43833,
    "original_end_ms": 45573
  },
  {
    "start": 45.573,
    "end": 48.033,
    "text": "你试试，看看这次能不能守住。",
    "source": "BCut ASR",
    "original_start_ms": 45573,
    "original_end_ms": 48033
  }
]